-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 8, §8.3 מדריך
-- The instructor (מדריך, a supervision grade): the work unit, the
-- instruction allowance by the table, and the seniority a move into
-- supervision carries with it.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

GIVEN d IS A DATE, e IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE d `is on or after` e IF
    DATE_SERIAL d AT LEAST DATE_SERIAL e

§ `8.3 מדריך`

@desc A teaching employee approved for the instructor grade, as far as section 8.3 asks about it.
DECLARE `instructor` HAS
    `personal combined salary`       IS A NUMBER @desc the personal combined salary (השכר המשולב האישי); an input
    `position fraction`              IS A NUMBER @desc the share of a full position held in the instructor grade (1 = full)
    `table rate`                     IS A NUMBER @desc the percentage the table of section 8.3.6.1 gives this instructor (in force from 1.1.01); the table is not part of the text this file encodes, so the rate is an input, as a fraction (0.5 = 50%)
    `civil-service work unit`        IS A NUMBER @desc the weekly work unit customary for state employees, which section 8.3.1 adopts; an input

§§ `8.3.1 יחידת עבודה`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_1__para_1
GIVEN i IS AN `instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `instructor's work unit` i IS
    i's `civil-service work unit`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_1/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_1/p2 Source: a director-general's circular.

§§ `8.3.6 גמול הדרכה`

-- §8.3.6.1: the allowance is a percentage of the personal combined salary
-- "by the table below". The table is not in the text as the corpus holds this
-- section, so the percentage is the input `table rate`.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_1 akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_2__subpara_a
GIVEN i IS AN `instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `full-position instructor allowance` i IS
    i's `table rate` TIMES i's `personal combined salary`

-- The table applies from 1.1.01; the text gives no table before it.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_1/p2
GIVEN `the month` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the table applies in` `the month` IF
    `the month` `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 1 2001)

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_2__subpara_b
GIVEN i IS AN `instructor`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `instructor allowance` i IS
    `full-position instructor allowance` i TIMES i's `position fraction`

@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_2__subpara_c
GIVEN i IS AN `instructor`
      `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` IS A NUMBER
          @desc the rest of the monthly base from which the overtime hourly value is derived (section 1.24); an input
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `overtime hourly-value base` i `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` IS
    `the other components of the salary the hourly value is computed from` PLUS `instructor allowance` i

§§ `8.3.6.3 גרירת ותק במעבר לפיקוח`

@desc The moves section 8.3.6.3 says how much seniority they carry.
DECLARE `move into supervision` IS ONE OF
    `teacher in an instruction role to supervision`  @desc subsection (a)
    `teacher-instructor to instructor`               @desc subsections (b) and (d)
    `instructor to supervisor`                       @desc subsections (b) and (d)
    `teacher-instructor to supervisor`               @desc subsection (d)
    `school principal to supervision`                @desc subsections (c) and (d): a principal, not a deputy or other role holder
    `deputy or other role holder to supervision`     @desc excluded from (c) by its own words; whether (d) covers it is F-8.3-b

DECLARE `supervision move` HAS
    `the move`                                  IS A `move into supervision`
    `years in the previous role`                IS A NUMBER @desc years of seniority in the role being left
    `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS A NUMBER @desc for subsection (a): seniority as a teacher in an instruction role, counted from 1.9.83
    `seniority ceiling`                         IS A NUMBER @desc the ceiling subsection (d) makes the count subject to; the text says "today 13 years", so it is an input

-- (a): counted from 1.9.83; at most 7 years (the span from 1.9.83 to the
-- agreement's signature on 23.12.90).
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_3__subpara_a
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried from an instruction role` m IS
    min (m's `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83`) 7

-- (b): from one supervision role to the next, the seniority moves with the employee.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_3__subpara_b
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried between supervision roles` m IS
    m's `years in the previous role`

-- (c): a school principal moving into supervision carries 25% of the years as principal.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_3__subpara_c
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority a principal carries under (c)` m IS
    0.25 TIMES m's `years in the previous role`

-- (d): teacher-instructor or instructor to supervisor, OR MANAGEMENT TO
-- SUPERVISION: no limit, counted in full, subject to the ceiling.
@ref akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6__para_3__subpara_d
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried in full under (d)` m IS
    min (m's `years in the previous role`) (m's `seniority ceiling`)

-- F-8.3-a: (c) and (d) both decide a principal moving into supervision, and
-- give 25% and 100%. The reading adopted: (c) governs a principal — it is
-- the clause that names the principal and excludes deputies, and its
-- footnote is the Treasury's later clarification (6.5.91).
GIVEN m IS A `supervision move`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `seniority carried into supervision` m IS
    CONSIDER m's `the move`
    WHEN `teacher in an instruction role to supervision` THEN `seniority carried from an instruction role` m
    WHEN `teacher-instructor to instructor`              THEN `seniority carried between supervision roles` m
    WHEN `instructor to supervisor`                      THEN `seniority carried in full under (d)` m
    WHEN `teacher-instructor to supervisor`              THEN `seniority carried in full under (d)` m
    WHEN `school principal to supervision`               THEN `seniority a principal carries under (c)` m
    WHEN `deputy or other role holder to supervision`    THEN 0

`a principal of eight years moves into supervision` MEANS
    `supervision move` WITH
        `the move`                                  IS `school principal to supervision`
        `years in the previous role`                IS 8
        `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS 0
        `seniority ceiling`                         IS 13

`(c) and (d) give a principal moving into supervision different seniority` MEANS
    NOT (`seniority a principal carries under (c)` `a principal of eight years moves into supervision`
         EQUALS `seniority carried in full under (d)` `a principal of eight years moves into supervision`)
#ASSERT `(c) and (d) give a principal moving into supervision different seniority`

-- F-8.3-b: (c) excludes a deputy and any other role holder; (d) counts in
-- full a move "from management to supervision" without saying whether a
-- deputy's management is that. Reading adopted: a deputy carries none —
-- (d)'s "management" is the principal's, the move (c) names.
`a deputy of eight years moves into supervision` MEANS
    `supervision move` WITH
        `the move`                                  IS `deputy or other role holder to supervision`
        `years in the previous role`                IS 8
        `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS 0
        `seniority ceiling`                         IS 13

`whether a deputy moving from management carries seniority under (d) decides between none and all of it` MEANS
    NOT (`seniority carried into supervision` `a deputy of eight years moves into supervision`
         EQUALS `seniority carried in full under (d)` `a deputy of eight years moves into supervision`)
#ASSERT `whether a deputy moving from management carries seniority under (d) decides between none and all of it`
#ASSERT `seniority carried into supervision` `a principal of eight years moves into supervision` EQUALS 2

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6/p1 Heading of the source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6/p2 Source: collective agreement of 23.10.90.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6/p3 Source: collective agreement of 18.12.01.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6/p4 Source: special collective agreement of 10.3.83, annex D.
-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_6/p5 Source: a Treasury wage-department clarification of 6.5.91.

§§ `8.3.7 גמול השתלמות`

-- akn:chp_8__sec_8_3__ssec_8_3_7/p1 A pointer to section 8.4.7 (the in-service training allowance for supervisors), encoded there.

§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples. The salary, table rate and work unit are placeholders.
`a full-position instructor` MEANS
    `instructor` WITH
        `personal combined salary` IS 10000
        `position fraction`        IS 1
        `table rate`               IS 0.5
        `civil-service work unit`  IS 42.5

#ASSERT `instructor allowance` `a full-position instructor` EQUALS 5000

`an instructor of fifteen years becomes a supervisor` MEANS
    `supervision move` WITH
        `the move`                                  IS `instructor to supervisor`
        `years in the previous role`                IS 15
        `years in an instruction role since 1.9.83` IS 0
        `seniority ceiling`                         IS 13
#ASSERT `seniority carried into supervision` `an instructor of fifteen years becomes a supervisor` EQUALS 13
